commitForecast
|-- when marketId is zero
|   `-- it reverts with ZeroMarketId
|-- when commitmentHash is zero
|   `-- it reverts with ZeroCommitment
|-- when resolutionTime is now or in the past
|   `-- it reverts with InvalidResolutionTime
|-- when the caller already committed for the market
|   `-- it reverts with CommitmentAlreadyExists
`-- when all inputs are valid
    |-- it stores the exact hash, block, timestamp, resolution time, and unrevealed state
    |-- it emits the exact ForecastCommitted fields
    |-- it accepts the last future second
    `-- it permits a different caller to commit for the same market

revealForecast
|-- when marketId is zero
|   `-- it reverts with ZeroMarketId
|-- when probabilityBps exceeds 10000
|   `-- it reverts with ProbabilityOutOfRange
|-- when modelRunId is zero
|   `-- it reverts with ZeroModelRunId before reading commitment storage
|-- when the caller has no commitment for the market
|   |-- another caller cannot reveal someone else's commitment
|   `-- it reverts with CommitmentNotFound
|-- when the forecast was already revealed
|   `-- it reverts with AlreadyRevealed
|-- when resolutionTime has not arrived
|   `-- it reverts with RevealTooEarly
|-- when any committed preimage field is wrong
|   |-- wrong probability, modelRunId, salt, or committed resolution is rejected
|   `-- fuzzed corruptions revert with CommitmentMismatch
`-- when the preimage is valid and resolutionTime has arrived
    |-- it accepts probabilities from 0 through 10000 bps
    |-- it marks the commitment revealed without changing commit metadata
    `-- it emits the exact ForecastRevealed fields

computeCommitment
|-- when called with a forecast preimage
|   |-- it equals keccak256(abi.encode(address(this), chainid, caller, market, resolution, probability, run, salt))
|   `-- another registry address produces another commitment

value surface
|-- when ETH is sent with empty calldata
|   `-- it rejects the transfer
`-- when ETH is sent to any state-changing or read-only function
    `-- every call rejects the transfer and the registry balance stays zero
